or him to propose marriage to her.<br><br>Miya decided to ask Haruto to be her husband, but he refused her. Computer games were more important to him than love!<br><br>She was very angry! <br><br>Miya decided to make her boyfriend's life a living hell!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584650/extras/ec36a0c3cdebd01f83f967351e0e4a5d.poster.avif?t=1748325244\" width=362 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584650/extras/ec36a0c3cdebd01f83f967351e0e4a5d.webm?t=1748325244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584650/extras/ec36a0c3cdebd01f83f967351e0e4a5d.mp4?t=1748325244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
